<title>HONG KONG: Cheung Kong group shares to resume trading.</title>
<headline>Cheung Kong group shares to resume trading.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Cheung Kong (Holdings) Ltd, Cheung Kong Infrastructure Holidings Ltd, Hutchison Whampoa Ltd and Hongkong Electric Holdings Ltd, resume trading on Tuesday, the Hong Kong stock exchange confirmed on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Trading of the companies' shares was suspended on Monday pending an announcement in relation to a major corporate reshuffling.</p>
<p>The reorganisation includes making a general offer on Hongkong Electric at HK$26.50 per share.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
